#: index.html
msgid ""
"ArchLinux Tweak Tool (ATT) is a GTK4 application for Arch-based systems: 31 "
"pages covering desktops, kernels, Plymouth, SDDM, themes, packages, "
"services, performance and maintenance. Free, open, and never a black box."
msgstr ""
"ArchLinux Tweak Tool (ATT) es una aplicación GTK4 para sistemas basados en "
"Arch: 31 páginas que cubren escritorios, kernels, Plymouth, SDDM, temas, "
"paquetes, servicios, rendimiento y mantenimiento. Gratuita, abierta y nunca "
"una caja negra."

